    "API Key" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "API Key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API Key 只保存在这台设备的钥匙串里。文字用你的 Key 直接发给服务商，不经过我们的服务器，费用由服务商按你的账户计算。「自定义接口」可以接 DeepSeek、通义千问、Kimi、智谱、豆包等兼容 OpenAI 格式的服务。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "API keys are stored only in this device's keychain. Text is sent with your key directly to the provider, not through our servers, and the provider bills your account. “Custom Endpoint” works with OpenAI-compatible services such as DeepSeek, Qwen, Kimi, Zhipu GLM and Doubao."
          }
        }
      }
    },
