            "value" : "Checkup Follow-Up"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "体检报告、合同、保修卡、发票，照片、PDF、Word、Excel 都可以。多页的纸质文件可以一次选几张照片。文字先在手机上识别。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Medical reports, contracts, warranties, invoices — photos, PDF, Word and Excel all work. For a multi-page paper document, pick several photos at once. Text is recognized on your iPhone first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "体检报告、合同、保修卡、发票：AI 总结要点记进笔记，并建议复查、到期等提醒。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Medical reports, contracts, warranties, invoices: AI sums up the key points in a note and suggests follow-up or renewal reminders."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "体检报告、合同、保修卡、发票：AI 总结要点记进笔记，并建议复查、到期等提醒。上面写的话会一起交给 AI，比如说明这是什么、要记什么。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Medical reports, contracts, warranties, invoices: AI sums up the key points in a note and suggests follow-up or renewal reminders. What you write above goes to the AI too, such as what the file is or what to record."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "体检报告出来了，甘油三酯偏高 2.1，医生说注意饮食，三个月后复查血脂。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The checkup results are in: triglycerides a bit high at 2.1. The doctor said to watch my diet and recheck blood lipids in three months."
          }
        }
      }
    },
