    "先想一想再回答：很长很乱的一段话、读合同和报告时更准。会慢一些，费用也高一些。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Thinks before answering: more accurate for long, messy speech and for reading contracts and reports. Slower, and costs a bit more."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先用本机模型；本机不可用、或者整理得不对时，再交给选中的云端 AI（这时会慢一些）。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uses the on-device model first; if it's unavailable or gets it wrong, hands off to the selected cloud AI (a bit slower)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先记在「账本 › 应收应付」，不算进支出。付钱时点「付了」，再记成支出。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kept in Ledger › Receivables & Payables first, not counted as spending. When you pay, tap “Paid” to log it as an expense."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先记在「账本 › 应收应付」，不算进收入。收到钱时点「收到了」，再记成收入。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kept in Ledger › Receivables & Payables first, not counted as income. When you're paid, tap “Received” to log it as income."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "免费、不用联网，文字不会离开手机。下载一次后完全在手机上运行，整理效果比 Apple Intelligence 好得多。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Free and offline; text never leaves your iPhone. Download it once and it runs entirely on your iPhone, tidying far better than Apple Intelligence."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "免费、不用联网，文字不会离开手机。模型较小，中文口语整理得一般，可能留下「嗯」「然后那个」。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Free and offline; text never leaves your iPhone. The model is small and handles casual Chinese speech only so-so, sometimes leaving filler words."
