    "别人欠你的、你欠别人的钱先记在这里，不算进收支。收到或付出时点一下，就记成一笔收入或支出。\n也可以直接说「张三还欠我两千」「还欠装修师傅三千工钱」。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Money others owe you and money you owe goes here first, without counting as income or spending. When it's paid, one tap logs it as income or an expense.\nYou can also just say “Sam still owes me 2,000” or “I owe the plumber 3,000 for labor”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
