    "待办" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To-Dos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "待办、账本、账单、到期、笔记和设置里的账户、分类、预算都在一个文件里，可以存到「文件」或 iCloud 云盘。换手机或重装后用「从备份恢复」找回。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To-dos, ledger, bills, expiries, notes, plus the accounts, categories and budgets in Settings — all in one file you can save to Files or iCloud Drive. Use “Restore from Backup” after switching phones or reinstalling."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "待办、账本、账单、到期、笔记和附件，在登录同一个 Apple 账户的设备之间自动同步。数据存在你自己的 iCloud 里，我们的服务器看不到。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To-dos, ledger, bills, expiries, notes and attachments sync automatically between devices signed in to the same Apple Account. The data lives in your own iCloud; our servers can't see it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
