    "按住图表左右拖动，查看每天的支出。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Touch and drag across the chart to see each day's spending."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按内容决定：一两句话的记账、待办直接快速出结果；很长很乱的口述和整理笔记稍微多想；读报告、合同用均衡，特别长的文件用深入。快速的结果没通过检查时，自动加强重试一次。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chosen by content: short expenses and to-dos get fast results; long, messy dictation and note tidying think a little more; reports and contracts use Balanced, and very long files use Thorough. If a fast result fails the checks, it retries once with more effort."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按周" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
