      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "By Year"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按意思把口述写成通顺的句子：补标点、去重复、理顺前后颠倒的地方，事实和数字一个不少；改得不对时自动退回只去口头禅。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rewrites dictation into clear sentences: adds punctuation, removes repetition and straightens out jumbled order, keeping every fact and number. If the rewrite goes wrong, it falls back to removing fillers only."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按意思理顺了语句，事实和数字都保留着。不满意可以直接改，或展开原话对照。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The sentences were smoothed out with every fact and number kept. Edit freely, or expand to compare with what you said."
