    "更大，方言和口音重时更准一些。需要 8GB 内存的机型：iPhone 15 Pro、iPhone 16 全系及以后。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Larger, and a bit more accurate with dialects and heavy accents. Needs a device with 8 GB of memory: iPhone 15 Pro, all iPhone 16 models and later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "更小更快，给 iPhone 15 等 6GB 内存的机型用。明显不如 4B 准：偶尔会漏记、记错金额，建议配合「自动」模式，本机没记好时再交给云端。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Smaller and faster, for 6 GB devices like iPhone 15. Noticeably less accurate than 4B: it can miss items or get amounts wrong, so pair it with “Auto” mode to hand off to the cloud when needed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
