    },
    "铺砖" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lay tiles"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "长期跟踪的事（装修、看病、孩子成长）和要留着备查的资料，都可以记在这里。也可以直接在下方说出来，AI 会帮你归档。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Things you track over time (renovations, doctor visits, kids growing up) and records worth keeping all go here. You can also just say it below and AI will file it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "问一问" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ask"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "问点什么" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ask something"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "问花了多少、钱花在哪、还有什么待办、什么快到期，或者笔记里写过的事。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ask how much you spent, where it went, what's left to do, what's expiring, or anything you wrote in your notes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "问问你记过的" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ask what you've kept"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "问问你记过的东西" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ask about what you've kept"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "问随口记" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ask Ramble"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "问题" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Question"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "问题：%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Question: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "阿里通义千问 Qwen3-ASR（Apache 2.0 开源许可），通过苹果的 MLX 框架在手机上运行，从 Hugging Face 下载，之后完全离线，录音不离开手机。只在 Wi‑Fi 下下载，没连 Wi‑Fi 时会等连上再继续。下载时可以锁屏或切到别的 App，下载完回到这里会自动检查一次能否运行。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alibaba's Qwen3-ASR (Apache 2.0 open-source license) runs on your iPhone with Apple's MLX framework. It downloads from Hugging Face, then works fully offline; audio never leaves your iPhone. It downloads only on Wi‑Fi and waits for Wi‑Fi if needed. You can lock your iPhone or switch apps while it downloads; when you come back, it checks once that it runs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "阿里通义千问 Qwen（Apache 2.0 开源许可），通过苹果的 MLX 框架在手机上运行，从 Hugging Face 下载。只在 Wi‑Fi 下下载，没连 Wi‑Fi 时会等连上再继续。下载时可以锁屏或切到别的 App，下载完回到这里会自动检查一次能否运行。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alibaba's Qwen (Apache 2.0 open-source license) runs on your iPhone with Apple's MLX framework and downloads from Hugging Face. It downloads only on Wi‑Fi and waits for Wi‑Fi if needed. You can lock your iPhone or switch apps while it downloads; when you come back, it checks once that it runs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "附件（照片、文件）也会同步，会占用 iCloud 空间。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Attachments (photos, files) sync too and use iCloud storage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "随便说，比如：中午吃饭花了三十五，信用卡十五号要还，护照明年三月到期" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Just talk, like: spent 35 on lunch, credit card due on the 15th, passport expires next March"
          }
        }
      }
    },
