    },
    "需要兼容 OpenAI 的 Chat Completions 格式（地址一般以 /v1 结尾，App 会自动加上 /chat/completions）。DeepSeek、通义千问、Kimi、智谱、豆包、硅基流动、OpenRouter 都支持，也可以填局域网里自己运行的 Ollama（http://电脑的IP:11434/v1）。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Must be compatible with OpenAI Chat Completions (the URL usually ends in /v1; the app adds /chat/completions). DeepSeek, Qwen, Kimi, Zhipu GLM, Doubao, SiliconFlow and OpenRouter all work, as does Ollama on your local network (http://your-computer-IP:11434/v1)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "需要时可以再下载。" : {
